  "clearance_definition": "surface_distance(sphere centre, nearest collidable geom of body) - sphere_radius",
  "mesh_note": "box geoms (table, crate) exact; mesh geoms (apple/banana/orange/pear) use vertex-minimum = upper bound on distance",
